        "rewards_formatted": "冒险阅历 x350, 原石 x40, 大英雄的经验 x3, 摩拉 x30000, 精锻用魔矿 x6",
        "chapter": {
            "icon": "UI_ChapterIcon_Common",
            "id": "10059",
            "num": "",
            "title": "厄瑞玻斯的秘密"
        },
        "total_dialogue_lines": 64,
        "total_speaker_counts": {
            "Player": 11,
            "乌帽子": 50,
